From 6bde80700dfa49227d6509c8af35404fe7263ade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:28:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compartments: time zone and network strings of a persona app

The system server hands the time zone, the network country and the operator of the
place to the process of an app with a persona in its core settings; the process
reads them once into PersonaProcess and TelephonyManager answers with them. The
service loads the cell data for the operator, and the telephony registry treats
such an app as one without location access, so no real cell or area reaches it
through a listener.
